          <h4>Is the DNA Certificate Included in the Bird's Price?</h4>
          <p>It is not, and an earlier version of this page said otherwise. We have corrected that. The bird's price covers the bird; the certificate is a separate line you can see, question and decline to pay for if you would rather arrange your own testing through an avian vet.</p>

