          <h4>Which Carriers and Crate Standards We Use</h4>
          <p>Delta, United and American all run live-animal cargo programmes we have used for years, and the crate is ventilated, water-fitted and labelled to the IATA Live Animals Regulations. If you live within two or three hours of Midland, collecting in person is free and is genuinely the calmest option for the bird.</p>
